The app icon, in every size a desktop asks for.

  icons/hicolor/<size>x<size>/apps/backatit.png   16, 24, 32, 48, 64, 128, 256

These are generated from logo.png in the repository root. To change the logo,
replace logo.png (square, 256x256 or larger) and run:

  ./make-icons.sh

then rebuild the packages or reinstall. install.sh, build-deb.sh and
build-rpm.sh all pick up whatever sizes are here.
